{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2023-04-04 16:34:00', 'title': 'AMD\xa0NAMES JACK HUYNH SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER, COMPUTING AND GRAPHICS', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF., APRIL 04, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JACK HUYNH HAS BEEN NAMED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER OF COMPUTING AND GRAPHICS FOLLOWING THE RETIREMENT FROM AMD OF RICK BERGMAN, CURRENTLY THE EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF COMPUTING AND GRAPHICS. BERGMAN WILL REMAIN AT AMD THROUGH THE SECOND QUARTER TO ENSURE A SMOOTH TRANSITION. HUYNH HAS BEEN AT AMD FOR MORE THAN 24 YEARS AND WAS MOST RECENTLY RESPONSIBLE FOR LEADING ALL ASPECTS OF THE COMPANY'S SEMI-CUSTOM BUSINESS. HE WILL REPORT TO AMD CHAIR AND CEO DR. LISA SU."}